<title>Specification of the Arcadia Asset Definition Language (draft, v0.1)</title>
</head>
<body class="my-content-page-1">
  <header>
    <div class="navigation breadcrumbs">
      <a href="@{siteAddress}/">Home</a> / <a href="@{siteAddress}/Arcadia/ADL/">Arcadia ADL</a>
    </div>
